# Generated outputs.
# The pipeline regenerates everything under reports/ and data/ from scratch via
# `make backtest`, so committing them would let a stale artifact contradict the
# code that claims to produce it. The README's numbers are reproduced by running
# the pipeline, not by reading a checked-in file.
reports/
data/raw/
data/processed/

